    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51010" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vĭŏla</span></b> , ae,
			f.
		dim.
		Gr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the violet</i>, <i>the stock-gillyflower.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 21, 6,
				14, § 27</span></i>; <i><span class="en">21, 11, 38, §
			64</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Verg. E. 2, 47</span></i>; <i><span class="en">10, 39</span></i>.
			—Collect.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">an tu me in violā putabas aut in
					rosā dicere?</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Tusc. 5, 26, 73 al.</span></i>
			— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A violet color</i>, <i>violet</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Hor.
				C. 3, 10, 14</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Ep. 2, 1,
			207</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 34, 12, 32, § 124</span></i>; <i><span class="en">37, 9, 40, §
			121</span></i>.</div>
